{"parentUuid":"e00df071-d834-4b60-a05d-2ffcd763fbd6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a17047a6cc88ea783","message":{"id":"706ba715-c95d-4bf1-8d24-2f1f3d000cf2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have completed the analysis of the PRD document and created a detailed implementation plan. Let me summarize what I've done:\n\n1. Read and analyzed the PRD document at C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack\\bank-dashboard\\03-A-risk-engine-and-bank.md\n2. Created the required directory structure: scoring/, bank/, and data/ with subdirectories (replay/, models/, features/, bank/)\n3. Created a comprehensive IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md that breaks down the work into 8 parallel work streams following the build order and requirements (A-01 through A-15, BK-01 through BK-10)\n\nThe implementation plan identifies:\n- 3 independent streams that can start immediately (Data Foundation, Risk Engine Stub, Bank Stub)\n- 5 dependent streams that build upon previous work\n- Clear deliverables for each stream\n- Dependency mapping and critical path\n- Parallelization opportunities\n- Risk mitigation strategies\n- Handoff points aligned with the PRD's build order\n\nI've provided updates to the main conversation as requested. The plan is ready for execution by multiple agents working in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"4dfec715-2f9a-4165-81c9-11f491d97428","timestamp":"2026-10-17T13:54:58.555Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack","sessionId":"bf17b420-9618-43bc-84f2-60c55630bfc5","version":"2.1.268","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"4dfec715-2f9a-4165-81c9-11f491d97428","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a17047a6cc88ea783","message":{"id":"706ba715-c95d-4bf1-8d24-2f1f3d000cf2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed analyzing the PRD document and created a detailed implementation plan. Here's what I've accomplished:\n\n**Analysis Complete:**\n- Read and understood PRD 03 (A) requirements for the classical risk engine and synthetic bank\n- Identified all components: scoring/ (risk engine), bank/ (synthetic bank), and data handling\n- Mapped requirements A-01 through A-15 and BK-01 through BK-10 to specific implementation tasks\n\n**Implementation Plan Created:**\nI've created a comprehensive plan at `C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack\\IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` that breaks the work into 8 parallel work streams:\n\n1. **Stream 1: Data Foundation** (H0-H2) - Independent\n   - Dataset acquisition and initial analysis\n   - Time-based split (60/20/20 train/validation/test)\n   - Account ID strategy determination\n\n2. **Stream 2: Risk Engine Stub** (H0-H1) - Independent\n   - Basic scoring package with load(), score() returning fixed 0.1, ingest() doing nothing\n\n3. **Stream 3: Bank Stub** (H0-H1) - Independent\n   - Stub bank on port 9000 with all endpoints returning ALLOW\n   - Settle endpoint idempotent by txn_id\n\n4. **Stream 4: Model Development** (H2-H6) - Depends on Stream 1\n   - Train raw-gbm-v1 and gfp-gbm-v1 models\n   - Hyperparameter tuning on validation data\n   - Portable model formats and VM load testing\n\n5. **Stream 5: Graph Feature Implementation** (H2-H6) - Depends on Streams 1 & 4\n   - GFP history graph construction at load()\n   - Startup time measurement (<90s target)\n   - Offline/online consistency\n\n6. **Stream 6: Feature Export & Intermediate Features** (H6-H8) - Depends on Streams 1, 4, & 5\n   - QML feature export implementation\n   - Bank registry (accounts.csv) and opening balances\n   - Frozen bank rules and capacity model\n\n7. **Stream 7: Bank Functionality & Policy** (H8-H10) - Depends on Streams 1, 4, 5, & 6\n   - Account tiers and policy.json\n   - Bank channel (/bank/pay, /bank/verify) and books\n   - Bank.log streaming and test switches\n   - Standby ingest and reason codes\n   - Fast-model hook for downgrade baseline\n\n8. **Stream 8: Finalization & Documentation** (H10-H17) - Depends on all previous streams\n   - Brownout switch implementation\n   - Comprehensive documentation (bank/README.md, scoring/REPORT.md)\n   - Error analysis and accelerator comparison (if applicable)\n\n**Key Insights:**\n- Streams 1, 2, and 3 can begin immediately and run in parallel\n- Clear dependency chain: Data → Models → Graph Features → Feature Export/Bank Registry → Bank Functionality → Finalization\n- Risk mitigation strategies for SnapML availability, LightGBM compilation, memory constraints, and graph build speed\n- Handoff points aligned with PRD build order (H1, H2, H6/CP1, H8, H10/CP2, H12, H13, H16.5, H17)\n\nThe plan is ready for execution by multiple agents working in parallel on the identified independent streams."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":39162,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1122,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8138c9ec-d5d5-4bbd-b4b5-4586a189ac05","timestamp":"2026-10-17T13:55:13.928Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack","sessionId":"bf17b420-9618-43bc-84f2-60c55630bfc5","version":"2.1.268","gitBran